<title>ESTONIA: TALSE INDEX SETS NEW RECORD LEVEL AT 430.53.</title>
<headline>TALSE INDEX SETS NEW RECORD LEVEL AT 430.53.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Talse index rose to a new record high of 430.03 on Monday, passing the previous high set on August 8 of 422.27, according to final trading data released by the Tallinn stock exchange.</p>
<p>Hansapank turned over 102 million kroons, which dealers say is a record for a single stock during a session.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
